nsformations or non-parametric', 0.9950199028947851], [[[180.0, 1036.0], [505.0, 1036.0], [505.0, 1066.0], [180.0, 1066.0]], 'methods will be employed.', 0.9615040469169617], [[[181.0, 1100.0], [1271.0, 1098.0], [1271.0, 1128.0], [181.0, 1130.0]], 'Statistical computations will be performed using SAS 9.4 or higher. If additional statistical', 0.9870198330571575], [[[181.0, 1135.0], [923.0, 1135.0], [923.0, 1165.0], [181.0, 1165.0]], 'software is required, this will be discussed in the study report.', 0.9964242990200336], [[[180.0, 1200.0], [603.0, 1200.0], [603.0, 1230.0], [180.0, 1230.0]], '7.2 Adjustments for Covariates', 0.9665316085020701], [[[181.0, 1261.0], [1342.0, 1263.0], [1342.0, 1293.0], [181.0, 1291.0]], 'All analyses will be adjusted for randomization stratification factors (NRN site and dichotomous', 0.9897660128772259], [[[179.0, 1296.0], [1334.0, 1297.0], [1334.0, 1327.0], [179.0, 1326.0]], 'GA (< 26 weeks vs. ≥ 26 weeks)). Table summaries will be presented overall, and by GA strata.', 0.9860603710015615], [[[180.0, 1332.0], [1329.0, 1332.0], [1329.0, 1361.0], [180.0, 1361.0]], 'Model-based analyses and test statistics examining the effect of budesonide will be adjusted for', 0.9885931896666685], [[[177.0, 1365.0], [1347.0, 1364.0], [1347.0, 1397.0], [177.0, 1398.0]], 'NRN study site and gestational age strata where possible. For example, the primary outcome will', 0.992166102559943], [[[178.0, 1400.0], [1311.0, 1401.0], [1311.0, 1431.0], [178.0, 1430.0]], 'be tested via a robust Poisson regression model, for which study site and gestational age strata', 0.9946984810133775], [[[180.0, 1434.0], [1314.0, 1435.0], [1314.0, 1465.0], [180.0, 1464.0]], 'will be controlled as fixed effects. If enrollment at a specific site is low (less than 10 infants in', 0.9926653828951392], [[[181.0, 1469.0], [1301.0, 1469.0], [1301.0, 1502.0], [181.0, 1502.0]], 'either gestational age stratum), then that site will be pooled with another site belonging to the', 0.9949295